  "description": "HTML to RTF .Net is 100% C# assembly to convert HTML documents into RTF, DOCX and Text formats. Can also Merge RTF documents and replace text in them.\n\t\t\tAbsolutely standalone solution, doesn't require MS Office or any other. Requires only .NET Framework 4.6.2 and up or .NET 6.0 and up.\n\t\t\tThe component can read and parse all types of HTML: HTML 3.2, HTML 4.01, HTML 5 with CSS and XHTML 1.01. The component has own HTML parser, DOCX and RTF writers.",
